  "instructions": [
    "heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "add the chicken and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "add the smoked paprika and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "add the garlic and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "add the Arborio rice and stir for 1-2 minutes.",
    "add the saffron, chicken broth, and lime leaves; bring to a boil.",
    "reduce heat to low, cover, and simmer for 20-25 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "remove from heat, season with sea salt to taste, and garnish with parsley.",
    "let stand 5 minutes before serving.",
    "serve hot."
